<title>USA: Nautica to buy back up to 1.5 mln shares.</title>
<headline>Nautica to buy back up to 1.5 mln shares.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-01-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nautica Enterprises Inc on Wednesday said its board of directors approved a plan to buy back up to 1.5 million shares of its common stock.  </p>
<p>&quot;Our board of directors feels that at the current range of prices, our stock will generate an excellent return on investment,&quot; it said.</p>
<p>Nautica had a total of 43.3 million average shares outstanding when it reported fiscal third-quarter earnings on January 3.</p>
<p>In midday trading on the Nasdaq, the stock was up 3/8 at 24, against a 52-week low of 17-3/4 and a high of 37.</p>
